termuxgui: Termux:GUI output/input backend with OpenGL (surfaceless EGL) and QPainter paths

Self-contained: contains the Termux:GUI integration (activity, surface view,
touch input, hardware buffers) plus OpenGL compositing through
EGL_MESA_platform_surfaceless with dma-buf or readback presentation, and the
QPainter fallback. Applies after 0001-0004.

